roisterous of some kind got in ahead of you or they didn't like lions or something then where

01:22:15.890 --> 01:22:21.730
is the battery park police station why in battery park sir naturally and what are you waiting for

01:22:21.730 --> 01:22:26.370
get in you see what i told you hot dog let's go

01:22:31.240 --> 01:22:53.170
There aren't many bankers around here!

01:23:04.120 --> 01:23:05.350
I got to get out of here.

01:23:32.330 --> 01:23:32.790
Thank you.

01:24:10.080 --> 01:24:12.940
- Do you feel better now?

01:24:12.940 --> 01:24:14.820
Air would do you good.

01:24:14.820 --> 01:24:17.520
- Very kind of you.

01:24:17.520 --> 01:24:20.650
Oh yes, this is my cab, isn't it?

01:24:20.650 --> 01:24:21.490
What a day.

01:24:21.490 --> 01:24:24.130
Say, was I hanging off a line from a building

01:24:24.130 --> 01:24:25.810
or should I have a nightmare?

01:24:25.810 --> 01:24:27.310
- I'm afraid you did, Mr. Diddlebox.

01:24:27.310 --> 01:24:28.480
I mean, hang off the building,

01:24:28.480 --> 01:24:30.000
but I really wish you wouldn't anymore.

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:30.940
Now that it isn't necessary.

01:24:30.960 --> 01:24:31.880
You wish I would.

01:24:32.100 --> 01:24:33.880
I mean, now that you're a member of the firm and everything.

01:24:34.180 --> 01:24:35.180
What firm is that?

01:24:35.280 --> 01:24:37.240
Why, Waggleberry and Company, where you always work.

01:24:37.320 --> 01:24:38.280
You say I'm a...

01:24:38.280 --> 01:24:39.340
But of course you are.

01:24:39.500 --> 01:24:41.740
Mr. Waggleberry said that Sergeant's free circus idea

01:24:41.740 --> 01:24:43.720
was the best advertising idea he'd heard of

01:24:43.720 --> 01:24:45.060
