01:26:53.630 --> 01:26:55.560
What I want to do is to learn how to forget.

01:26:55.560 --> 01:26:56.800
Remember that you're married.

01:26:56.800 --> 01:26:57.800
Remember that I married you.

01:26:57.800 --> 01:26:58.780
How's that again?

01:26:58.780 --> 01:27:00.000
I said, don't you remember marrying?

01:27:00.990 --> 01:27:02.050
Marrying you, Mr. Diddlebock?

01:27:02.130 --> 01:27:04.210
How could I possibly remember marrying you, Mr. Diddlebock,

01:27:04.250 --> 01:27:06.150
in the first place your name is, Mr. Diddlebock,

01:27:06.210 --> 01:27:06.870
and the second place...

01:27:06.870 --> 01:27:08.810
You mean you don't remember coming out to Flatbush

01:27:08.810 --> 01:27:10.590
in the middle of the night with a full orchestra?

01:27:10.810 --> 01:27:11.050
Flatbush!

01:27:11.050 --> 01:27:12.510
And waking up the whole neighborhood

01:27:12.510 --> 01:27:13.950
while you told Mother it was about time

01:27:13.950 --> 01:27:15.270
he did something about one of her daughters

01:27:15.270 --> 01:27:17.190
and then wrapping me in a long velvet cloak

01:27:17.190 --> 01:27:19.070
that turned out afterwards to be a window curtain

01:27:19.070 --> 01:27:21.450
and then galloping all the way back to New Jersey.

01:27:21.770 --> 01:27:22.790
I'll bet you, Ellis...

01:27:22.790 --> 01:27:25.230
